### Guidelines for Agent Configs

| Agent Type | Max Retries | Temperature | Max Tokens | Rationale |
|-----------|-------------|-------------|------------|-----------|
| **Tool-heavy** (searches) | 3 | 0.1 | 12000-16000 | More retries for API calls, low temp for factual |
| **Analysis** (reasoning) | 2-3 | 0.2 | 16000 | Higher tokens for complex reasoning |
| **Assessment** (judgment) | 2 | 0.1 | 8000 | Low temp for consistent results |
| **Enrichment** (structured) | 2 | 0.1 | 8000 | Low temp for deterministic output |

